\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Strong-willed, middle-class Kashaf and carefree, wealthy Zaroon meet in college, but before love can take root, they each have some growing up to do.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Mxw9WRmLkrLGCwaDJGNsMZsBs3.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2012-11-30\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"The pessimistic Kashas has worked diligently at her university exams, while the aristocratic Zaroon has little on his mind except women\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b4lHo1C80l3Lt1YJoxDcHSjkbMH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-11-30\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"A worried Kashaf calls to check on her mother and meets fellow student Zaroon who inadvertently insults Kashaf soon after meeting her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fCJJRYmBx0tDdeR6tFhuZVzOk4u.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-07\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Kashaf forms an unfavorable opinioin about carefree Zaroon, but Asmara gets jealous when other women shower Zaroon with attention.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xUHa6H22RGNr2mKhBhzMARoJIas.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-14\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Osama tries to forge a relationship with Kashaf. Meanwhile, Asmara notices that Zaroon starts to get competitive with Kashaf at school.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1jNulGsHsVEXhVYZHdrtaa8u6ho.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-21\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Rafia tries to talk Kashaf out of her bleak views on marriage, and Zaroon and Asmara spar over his attraction to Kashaf\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yLTbXmD8rq4K0GspRfKpa1moz9Z.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-28\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"As Zaroon and Asmara's estrangement grows, Murtaza threatens Rafia with eviction if an unwilling Kashaf doesn't marry Sajjad\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hEIt3bpuPTGzXfK8JmXbuPnqQnq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-04\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"When Kashaf starts to enjoy spending time with Osama, a jealous Zaroon turns on the charm to make Kashaf fall for him instead.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Z0RudEjHcKSHk9RJVEGLXUjXJp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-11\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"While Zaroon tries to win Kashaf over by showering her with kindness and gifts, Asmara and Kashaf get into heated argument.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2RB7VoXvaiShjAu8q3pwFfDmBbg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-18\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Zaroon finds himself in a bind,  caught between Kashaf and Asmara. Later, Kashaf overhears Zaroon saying that he's just toying with her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rRgGuJzIkK5mON2aYGLL7DyVzky.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-01-25\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Zaroon gets engaged to Asmara but continues to harbor doubts about their relationship. Meanwhile, Kashaf ponders a job offer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bEnERD5YN2AkeglyA3zTt3QtrC8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-01\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"Zaroon and Asmara's courtship is jeapordiezed when Zaroon moves to a distant city. Kashaf gives up her studies to accept a job offer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3k06EYoKuJII3YNTLRjGndMqvuH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-08\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Zaroon gets upset when Asmara goes to Dubai without telling him. Murtaza tries to make up with Kashaf after learning of her success in school.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w2CwaOti8TFmQ8Ou67p9vNlGCt6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-15\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"Zaroon gives Asmara an ultimatum regarding their engagement and confesses to Osama that he really wants to marry someone like Kashaf.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zvGNwPbR6dHKSI2frQJL4dSBRpF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-02-22\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"Now in the working world, Zaroon and Kashaf pick up their old pattern of competitiveness. Meanwhile, Osama surprises Kashaf with a marriage proposal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nwM9Ix87FtbaiyAn1UCeDZgNTXX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-01\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"Claiming she never wants to get married, Kashaf rejects Osama's proposal. Zaroon admits to Abrar that he wants to settle down with Kashaf.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ulnGhGbYBHLrizoyKTzHlVAqwlu.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-08\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"Shocked when Abrar tells her that Zaroon is a changed man and wants to marry her, Kashaf confronts Zaroon, who takes her wrath in stride.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/B9MKRi3L648VeazwcIecIVaLmv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-15\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Episode 17\",\"overview\":\"Kashaf decides to marry Osama but finds that he is already engaged. When she discovers Zaroon's true character, she agrees to  marry him instead.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/edghxo0fskv0s7TywwF0QVRzPNr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-22\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Episode 18\",\"overview\":\"Zaroon makes amends to Kashaf for his poor behavior in college and proves he's a new man, and the two finally tie the knot.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/83JyaKlM6mdtsxlFeQI5fv0NGyV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-03-29\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Episode 19\",\"overview\":\"As Zaroon and Kashaf's love continues to blossom and they settle into married life, they begin to revisit the past with fresh eyes.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yVysrjdmf33kVX7DWRqQsSERViK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-05\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Episode 20\",\"overview\":\"As normal life approaches, Zaroon enjoys the attention of his new in-laws, and Kashaf realizes she has yearned for married life after all.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yr5rtLx0cTWMnPaDPcRx0ZPtQCe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-12\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Episode 21\",\"overview\":\"The honeymoon is over as miscommunication, arguments and interference from their families encroach on Kashaf and Zaroon's new marriage.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xnL4ZbGqAuXRjgKCqKrBZNla5xL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-19\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Episode 22\",\"overview\":\"Tension erupts between the newlyweds when Zaroon learns that Osama had proposed to Kashaf. Meanwhile, Kashaf bonds with Sara.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s0j1SzdC90Rss6a9QcJgVjq8Z3a.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-04-26\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Episode 23\",\"overview\":\"Though their families adore each other, Kashaf and Zaroon nurse a stubborn grudge, untile Kashaf shares some big news.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kLjkiw1euSY1OhgIesIdSC4wWfm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-03\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Episode 24\",\"overview\":\"Zaroon and Kashaf share their good news with their familes, but things go sour when she catches him snooping through her phone.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a1myh8oJdZumBg2vDzvPi2NtJ8M.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-10\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Episode 25\",\"overview\":\"Zaroon wishes Kashaf would confide in him. A text message leads to Kashaf suspect Zaroon has been unfaithful. A dream serves as a wake-up call.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fjvYZaxDOdAN1IpH3kvrzr8zEsN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-17\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Episode 26\",\"overview\":\"Hurt pride keeps Kashaf and Zaroon from contacting each other, until one finally gives in to deliver some news, unsure of how it will be recieved.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s4K4uCKPxVyTwSIkk3qTXaj0Lu.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2013-05-24\",\"runtime\":40}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2012-11-30\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}